<title>POLAND: BFK OCT NET RISES TO PLN 2.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>BFK OCT NET RISES TO PLN 2.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.27 vs   0.93</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 5.03 vs   1.33</p>
<p> Operating profit     5.56 vs   2.68</p>
<p> Sales		   37.45 vs  32.99</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    23.05 vs  12.60</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	38.98 vs  17.40</p>
<p> Operating profit    46.57 vs  33.93</p>
<p> Sales		  307.82 vs 262.60</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish cable maker is Bydgoska Fabryka</p>
<p>Kabli SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
